@startuml pools
title Pools — the show's stored objects
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

[Stored] as stored
[Pool<Group>] as pg
[Pool<ColorPreset>] as pc
[Pool<DimmerPreset>] as pd
[Pool<Sequence>  (planned)] as seq #e65100
[Pool<Effect>  (planned)] as eff #e65100

stored --> pg
stored --> pc
stored --> pd
stored ..> seq
stored ..> eff

note bottom of pg
  Each Pool<T> is a numbered slot map
  (uint32_t -> shared_ptr<T>) with a name
  index, nextFree() gap-finding, and
  store/get/remove/move/rename.
end note
@enduml
